data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150624091609&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werebadger_644c87.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a werebadger.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>SNUFFLE</li><li>Sniff Sniff</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Werebadgers are humans under a curse - others claim infected with a disease - that causes them to transform into savage beasts. At the beginning, the transformation only takes place at full moon and the victim regains its human appearance the next morning. In the course of time, the transformation lasts longer and the full moon is no longer a necessary condition for the transformation. At a certain point, the beast takes over more and more often.\n</p><p>Werebadgers aren't very strong and tough but quick and clever in compensation. They are no real predators, but may nonetheless be a danger to the careless. Their appearance is a mix between a badger and a human being. Like badgers, Werebadgers favour caverns as homesteads.\n</p><p>\nThe curse of the Full Moon, as it is frequently called, is usually spread by the infectious bite or scratch of other were-creatures. Forbidden books also tell about methods that allow to turn somebody into a were-creature with the help of dark rites. Some twisted individuals even call the curse upon themselves in the hope of using their new powers to avenge an injustice or insult.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\nWerebadgers also drop Moonlight Crystals during the Full Moon.<br/><div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Werebadger_Promoart-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werebadger_Artwork_b80700.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Werebadger Promoart.jpg (268 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-170)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Mana Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mana_Drain_Icon_a3e6f8.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\">Mana Drain</a></span> (65-95)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\">Life Drain</a> Explosion similar to Thunderstorm area</span> (0-100; also causes <a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\">Paralysis</a>)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_3dcdcb.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Death Cloud Wave</span> (causes <a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a>; from 2 to 128+)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Death Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_3dcdcb.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Death Beam</span> (190-230)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Invisibility\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Invisible_Icon_ab037d.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Frequent <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Healing</span> (50-120; white spark effect on itself)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> White Notes Berserk on itself</span> (Summons 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\">Badgers</a> at once)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-r